+# Opt-in Perfetto TrackEvent instrumentation (Test-2 oracle for the ISP HAL).
+# Requires a real, prebuilt Perfetto SDK directory holding perfetto.h and
+# libperfetto.a. Never enabled implicitly: without the SDK the library builds
+# exactly as before and the HAL trace calls compile out.
+option(CAM_TRACE_TRACK_EVENT "Enable perfetto TrackEvent in libisc" OFF)
